[0.018, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[?25l\r\u001b[21A\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[1;34m> Write and build a complete C++ firmware for a 7-voice drum synth on the this.is.NOISE Gamma mini synth using\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[1;34m  libDaisy and DaisySP, mapping the drum voices to the front keys and filter controls to the knobs.\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[0 q\u001b[J\u001b[37m○\u001b[m \u001b[37mThought for 19.4s\u001b[m \u001b[37m(The task involves C++ firmware development for a 7-voice drum synthesizer. The target plat...)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mExplored\u001b[m 4 files \u001b[37m(SKILL.md, SKILL.md, SKILL.md, +1)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mRan\u001b[m 2 commands \u001b[37m(ls -la · ls -la .agents/skills/gamma-pinout/resources)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m… 9 more actions (4 reads, 5 commands: 1 failed) …\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mExplored\u001b[m 1 file \u001b[37m(setup.sh)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mRan\u001b[m 6 commands \u001b[37m(+3 · make -j -C libDaisy: failed · cd libDaisy && git s... · g"]
[0.000, "o", "it -C)\u001b[m \u001b[37m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\r\n\n  Initializing \u001b[94mlibDaisy\u001b[m submodules to prepare the build environment. I will proceed with designing and compiling\r\n  the drum synth firmware once this completes.\r\n\n\u001b[37m○\u001b[m \u001b[37mThought for 1m 24s\u001b[m \u001b[37m(`ModalVoice` offers physical modeling percussion sounds, particularly suitable for rimsho...)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mRan\u001b[m 3 commands \u001b[37m(cd DaisySP && git submodule status · make -j4 -C libDaisy · make -j4 -C DaisySP)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[32m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mExplored\u001b[m 4 files \u001b[37m(synthbassdrum.h, synthsnaredrum.h, hihat.h, +1)\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[33m●\u001b[m \u001b[33;1mRan\u001b[m \u001b[37m(find libDaisy/examples -name Makefile | head -n 3)\u001b[m \u001b[37m(ctrl+o to expand)\u001b[m\r\n\n\u001b[33;1mCommand\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────"]
[0.000, "o", "───────────────\u001b[m\r\n\n\u001b[37;1mRequesting permission for:\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m   find libDaisy/examples -name Makefile | head -n 3\u001b[m\r\n\n\u001b[1mRun this command?\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[94m> 1. Yes, run command\u001b[K\u001b[m\r\n  2. Yes, and always allow in this conversation for commands that start with 'find libDaisy/examples -name Makefile'\r\n  3. Yes, and always allow for commands that start with 'find libDaisy/examples -name Makefile' (Persist to\r\nsettings.json)\r\n  4. No, cancel\r\n\n  \u001b[94;1m↑/↓\u001b[90;22m Navigate · \u001b[94;1mtab\u001b[90;22m Amend · \u001b[94;1mctrl+g\u001b[90;22m edit/expand command\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90mesc to cancel\u001b[m\u001b[80X\u001b[80C\u001b[2mGemini 3.8 Flash · high\r\u001b[m\u001b[?2026l"]
