[0.017, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[27A\u001b[37m▸ Thought for 12s\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[37m  Examining the remaining voices, Voice 5 uses a swept-sine with cubic saturation, while Voice 6 creates a clap...\u001b[m\r\n  The complete 7-voice drum synth firmware has been written and successfully compiled for the \u001b[1mthis.is.NOISE Gamma\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[1mmini synth\u001b[m.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  The firmware project is located in \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk70b78c50071e57;file:///Users/brett/tmp/drum-synth-with-skills/workspace/drum_synth/\u0007drum_synth/\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 with the compiled binary ready at \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkf7da6de1646c4443;file:///Users/brett/tmp/drum-synth-with-skills/workspace/drum_synth/build/gamma_drum_synth.bin\u0007gamma_drum_synth.bin\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 and ELF\r\n  at \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk296038a83d3a2274;file:///Users/brett/tmp/drum-synth-with-skills/workspace/drum_synth/build/gamma_drum_synth.elf\u0007gamma_drum_synth.elf\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007.\u001b[K\r\n  ──────\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[1m### Sound Architecture: 7 Drum Voices\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  All voices are synthesized in real-time in \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk4dfc2930481f500a;file:///Users/brett/t"]
