[0.017, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[27A\u001b[K\n\u001b[37m▸ Thought for 12s\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[37m  Examining the remaining voices, Voice 5 uses a swept-sine with cubic saturation, while Voice 6 creates a clap...\u001b[m\r\n  The complete 7-voice drum synth firmware has been written and successfully compiled for the \u001b[1mthis.is.NOISE Gamma\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[1mmini synth\u001b[m.\r\n\u001b[K\n  The firmware project is located in \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkee266e3f90820775;file:///Users/brett/tmp/drum-synth-with-skills/workspace/drum_synth/\u0007drum_synth/\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 with the compiled binary ready at \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jke3511888b6d87809;file:///Users/brett/tmp/drum-synth-with-skills/workspace/drum_synth/build/gamma_drum_synth.bin\u0007gamma_drum_synth.bin\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 and ELF\r\n  at \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk6e9ca4a22fc9018e;file:///Users/brett/tmp/drum-synth-with-skills/workspace/drum_synth/build/gamma_drum_synth.elf\u0007gamma_drum_synth.elf\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007.\r\n  ──────\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[1m### Sound Architecture: 7 Drum Voices\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  All voices are synthesized in real-time in \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkc1ff0f58639edb74;file:///Users/brett/t"]
[0.000, "o", "mp/drum-synth-with-skills/workspace/drum_synth/main.cpp#L303-L417\u0007AudioCallback\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 without runtime heap allocations or unstable runaway\r\n  resonances:\r\n\u001b[K\n   Voice Index | Name | \u001b[6bEngine \u001b[6b| Synthesis Method & Characteristics\u001b[K\r\n  -\u001b[12b|-\u001b[5b|-\u001b[19b|-\u001b[68b\r\n\t\u001b[1m0\u001b[m \u001b[5b|  \u001b[94mBD\u001b[m  | \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkcf6777296a8d368;file:///Users/brett/tmp/drum-synth-with-skills/workspace/DaisySP/Source/Drums/synthbassdrum.h#L87\u0007SyntheticBassDrum\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007  | 909-style bass drum with distorted sine shaper, punchy pitch sweep\n\u001b[68D| envelope, and rich odd harmonics that cut through the internal\n\u001b[93D\u001b[1K | \u001b[5b|\u001b[20X\u001b[20C| speakers.\u001b[K\r\n\t\u001b[1m1\u001b[m \u001b[5b|  \u001b[94mSD\u001b[m  | \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk6027cc1f6a66ed3d;file:///Users/brett/tmp/drum-synth-with-skills/workspace/DaisySP/Source/Drums/synthsnaredrum.h#L34\u0007SyntheticSnareDrum\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 | Dual-oscillator core with 1.47 mode ratio coupled with snappy\n\u001b[92D\u001b[1K | \u001b[5b|\u001b[20X\u001b[20C| bandpass-filtered noise.\r\n\t\u001b[1m2\u001b[m \u001b[5b|  \u001b[94mCH\u001b[m  | \u001b[6b\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkaa9ccd931c53a293;fil"]
