[0.017, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[27A  The complete 7-voice drum synth firmware has been written and successfully compiled for the \u001b[1mthis.is.NOISE Gamma\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[J  \u001b[1mmini synth\u001b[m.\r\n\n  The firmware project is located in \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk8fef22ab6ba986e4;file:///Users/brett/tmp/drum-synth-with-skills/workspace/drum_synth/\u0007drum_synth/\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 with the compiled binary ready at \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkb95d251aefac2158;file:///Users/brett/tmp/drum-synth-with-skills/workspace/drum_synth/build/gamma_drum_synth.bin\u0007gamma_drum_synth.bin\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 and ELF\r\n  at \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk1224f20442de9193;file:///Users/brett/tmp/drum-synth-with-skills/workspace/drum_synth/build/gamma_drum_synth.elf\u0007gamma_drum_synth.elf\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007.\r\n  ──────\r\n  \u001b[1m### Sound Architecture: 7 Drum Voices\u001b[m\r\n\n  All voices are synthesized in real-time in \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk644cfb34b7bf1015;file:///Users/brett/tmp/drum-synth-with-skills/workspace/drum_synth/main.cpp#L303-L417\u0007AudioCallback\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 without runtime heap allocations or unstable runaway\r\n  resonances:\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\n   Voice Index | Name |\u001b[14X\u001b[14CEngine\u001b[15X\t\t  | Synthesis Method & Characteristics\r\n  -\u001b[12b|-\u001b[5b|-\u001b[34b|-\u001b[53b\r\n\t\u001b[1m0\u001b[m \u001b[5b|  \u001b[94mBD\u001b[m  | \u001b[8b\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk932cc526494410eb;file:///Users/brett/tmp/drum-synth-with-skills/workspace/DaisySP/Source/Drums/synthbassdrum.h#L87\u0007SyntheticBassDrum\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 \u001b[8b| 909-style bass drum with distorted sine shaper,\n\u001b[92D| \u001b[5b|\u001b[35X\u001b[35C| punchy pitch sweep envelope, and rich odd harmonics\n\u001b[96D| \u001b[5b|\u001b[35X\u001b[35C| that cut through the internal speakers.\r\n\t\u001b[1m1\u001b[m \u001b[5b|  \u001b[94mSD\u001b[m  | \u001b[7b\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk35e62225d3acafb4;file:///Users/brett/tmp/drum-synth-with-skills/workspace/DaisySP/Source/Drums/synthsnaredrum.h#L34\u0007SyntheticSnareDrum\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 \u001b[8b| Dual-oscillator core with 1.47 mode ratio coupled\n\u001b[94D| \u001b[5b|\u001b[35X\u001b[35C| with snappy bandpass-filtered noise.\r\n\t\u001b[1m2\u001b[m \u001b[5b|  \u001b[94mCH\u001b[m  |\u001b[15X\u001b[15C\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk2717ccce0c162a7a;file:///Users/brett/tmp/drum-synth-with-skills/workspace/DaisySP/Source/Drums/hihat.h#L117\u0007HiHat\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[15X\t\t  | 6-oscillator Schm"]
[0.000, "o", "itt trigger metallic cluster with\n\u001b[95D| \u001b[5b|\u001b[35X\u001b[35C| tight decay. Chokes open hat.\r\n\t\u001b[1m3\u001b[m \u001b[5b|  \u001b[94mOH\u001b[m  |\u001b[15X\u001b[15C\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk2717bfce0c161463;file:///Users/brett/tmp/drum-synth-with-skills/workspace/DaisySP/Source/Drums/hihat.h#L117\u0007HiHat\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[15X\t\t  | Open metallic hi-hat sizzle. Automatically choked\n\u001b[94D| \u001b[5b|\u001b[35X\u001b[35C| when Closed Hat (\u001b[94mCH\u001b[m) is triggered.\r\n\t\u001b[1m4\u001b[m \u001b[5b|  \u001b[94mLT\u001b[m  | [\u001b[94mTomVoice\u001b[m](file:///Users/brett/tm |\n\u001b[44D| \u001b[5b| \u001b[7bp/drum-synth-with- \u001b[8b|\n\u001b[44D| \u001b[5b| \u001b[8bskills/workspace/ \u001b[8b|\r\n⢿  \u001b[90mLoa\u001b[94mding.\u001b[90m..\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m└ Tip: Use /fork to branch the conversation from an earlier point.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[m"]
