[0.018, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\r\u001b[27A  All voices are synthesized in real-time in \u001b]8;id=jk37ddb1c91e3d50a4;file:///Users/brett/tmp/drum-synth-with-skills/workspace/drum_synth/main.cpp#L303-L417\u001b\\\u001b[4;34;4mA\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mu\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4md\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mi\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mo\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mC\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ma\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ml\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ml\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mb\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4ma\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mc\u001b[m\u001b[4;34;4mk\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u001b\\ without runtime heap allocations or unstable runaway\u001b[K\r\n  resonances:\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[?5W\u001b[J\n   Voice Index | Name | \u001b[6bEngine \u001b[6b| Synthesis Method & Characteristics\r\n  -\u001b[12b|-\u001b[5b|-\u001b[19b|-\u001b[68b\r\n\t\u001b[1m0\u001b[m \u001b[5b|  \u001b[94mBD\u001b[m  | \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk261e903ae4bc2dd8;file:///Users/brett/tmp/drum-synth-with-skills/workspace/DaisySP/Source/Drums/synthbassdrum.h#L87\u0007SyntheticBassDrum\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007  | 909-style bass drum with distorted sine shaper, punchy pitch sweep\n\u001b[96D| \u001b[5b|\u001b[20X\u001b[20C| envelope, and rich odd harmonics that cut through the internal\n\u001b[92D| \u001b[5b|\u001b[20X\u001b[20C| speakers.\r\n\t\u001b[1m1\u001b[m \u001b[5b|  \u001b[94mSD\u001b[m  | \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk62daa8e49edc6f4d;file:///Users/brett/tmp/drum-synth-wit"]
[0.000, "o", "h-skills/workspace/DaisySP/Source/Drums/synthsnaredrum.h#L34\u0007SyntheticSnareDrum\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 | Dual-oscillator core with 1.47 mode ratio coupled with snappy\n\u001b[91D| \u001b[5b|\u001b[20X\u001b[20C| bandpass-filtered noise.\r\n\t\u001b[1m2\u001b[m \u001b[5b|  \u001b[94mCH\u001b[m  | \u001b[6b\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk924aaea2aeaaaa03;file:///Users/brett/tmp/drum-synth-with-skills/workspace/DaisySP/Source/Drums/hihat.h#L117\u0007HiHat\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 \u001b[7b| 6-oscillator Schmitt trigger metallic cluster with tight decay.\n\u001b[93D| \u001b[5b|\u001b[20X\u001b[20C| Chokes open hat.\r\n\t\u001b[1m3\u001b[m \u001b[5b|  \u001b[94mOH\u001b[m  | \u001b[6b\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk924abba2aeaac01a;file:///Users/brett/tmp/drum-synth-with-skills/workspace/DaisySP/Source/Drums/hihat.h#L117\u0007HiHat\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 \u001b[7b| Open metallic hi-hat sizzle. Automatically choked when Closed Hat\n\u001b[95D| \u001b[5b|\u001b[20X\u001b[20C| (\u001b[94mCH\u001b[m) is triggered.\r\n\t\u001b[1m4\u001b[m \u001b[5b|  \u001b[94mLT\u001b[m  | \u001b[5b\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk4869b6e8b21798f8;file:///Users/brett/tmp/drum-synth-with-skills/workspace/drum_synth/main.cpp#L29-L93\u0007TomVoice\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 \u001b[5b| Swept-sine low tom (88 Hz root) with 45 ms exponential pitch"]
[0.000, "o", " drop\n\u001b[95D| \u001b[5b|\u001b[20X\u001b[20C| and cubic body saturation.\r\n\t\u001b[1m5\u001b[m \u001b[5b|  \u001b[94mHT\u001b[m  | \u001b[5b\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk231f85669e01b8f0;file:///Users/brett/tmp/drum-synth-with-skills/workspace/drum_synth/main.cpp#L29-L93\u0007TomVoice\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 \u001b[5b| Swept-sine high tom (160 Hz root) with fast pitch drop and snappy\n\u001b[95D| \u001b[5b|\u001b[20X\u001b[20C| transient.\r\n\t\u001b[1m6\u001b[m \u001b[5b|  \u001b[94mCP\u001b[m  | \u001b[4b\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk8feb61d4fb9323ea;file:///Users/brett/tmp/drum-synth-with-skills/workspace/drum_synth/main.cpp#L98-L186\u0007ClapVoice\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 \u001b[5b| Analog 808-style handclap: 3 distinct 11 ms noise bursts followed\n\u001b[95D| \u001b[5b|\u001b[20X\u001b[20C| by a 190 ms reverb tail through an 1150 Hz bandpass filter.\r\n  ──────\r\n  \u001b[1m### Hardware Control Mappings\u001b[m\r\n\n  \u001b[1m#### 1. Front Keys (7 Note Keys + 7 Chord Keys)\u001b[m\r\n\n  • \u001b[1mLef\u001b[m\r\n⣽  \u001b[90mLoading...\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m└ Tip: Use /fork to branch the conversation from an earlier point.\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────"]
