[0.000, "o", ";\u0007 \u001b[5b| Analog 808-style handclap: 3 distinct 11 ms noise bursts followed\n\u001b[65Dby a 190 ms reverb tail through an 1150 Hz bandpass filter.\r\n  ──────\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[1m### Hardware Control Mappings\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n\u001b[5C\u001b[1m# 1. Front Keys (7 Note Keys + 7 Chord Keys)\u001b[m\r\n\n  • \u001b[1mLeft Grid (Note Keys \u001b[94;22mN1\u001b[39;1m–\u001b[94;22mN7\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m: Triggers Voices 0–6 at normal velocity (accent = \u001b[94m0.80\u001b[m):\n\u001b[82D• \u001b[94mN1\u001b[m: \u001b[1mBD\u001b[m | \u001b[94mN2\u001b[m: \u001b[1mSD\u001b[m | \u001b[94mN3\u001b[m: \u001b[1mCH\u001b[m | \u001b[94mN4\u001b[m: \u001b[1mOH\u001b[m | \u001b[94mN5\u001b[m: \u001b[1mLT\u001b[m | \u001b[94mN6\u001b[m: \u001b[1mHT\u001b[m | \u001b[94mN7\u001b[m: \u001b[1mCP\u001b[m\n\u001b[64D\u001b[1mRight Grid (Chord Keys \u001b[94;22mC1\u001b[39;1m–\u001b[94;22mC7\u001b[39;1m)\u001b[m: Triggers Voices 0–6 with full accent (accent = \u001b[94m1.00\u001b[m). Allows expressive two-\r\n  handed finger drumming and rolls.\u001b[K\n\u001b[31DSampled in a 1 kHz hardware timer ISR (\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk735d5f8b1b1b177c;file:///Users/brett/tmp/drum-synth-with-skills/workspace/drum_synth/main.cpp#L254-L298\u0007TimerCallback\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007) with lock-free queueing to eliminate missed pres"]
